        </div>
        <div class="proj-body">
          <span class="proj-kind">Research</span>
          <h3 class="proj-title">Mental Health Stress Prediction</h3>
          <p class="proj-desc">Comparative study of classification algorithms for stress prediction, with XGBoost delivering the strongest accuracy across the evaluated models.</p>
